  "body_html": "<h1>daStep_NoAchievableRejection</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\nlemma daStep_NoAchievableRejection (s : DAState n) (hhold : HoldInv m s) (hinj : ∀ j1 j2 i : Fin n, s.holding j1 = some i → s.holding j2 = some i → j1 = j2) (hinv : NoAchievableRejection w m s) : NoAchievableRejection w m (daStep w m s)</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>HoldInv</li>\n<li>NoAchievableRejection</li>\n<li>IsAchievable</li>\n<li>isFree</li>\n<li>propTarget</li>\n<li>pref_list_mem</li>\n<li>IsPositiveAffineOf.symm</li>\n<li>Indifferent.symm</li>\n<li>isFree_iff</li>\n<li>daStep_holding</li>\n<li>daStep_nc_free</li>\n<li>daStep_nc_held</li>\n</ul>",
